 "name": "step-explainer",
 "version": 1,
 "title": "Step explainer: how a heat pump works",
 "summary": "A step-by-step explainer frame: a title, a big drawing driven by the step, step dots, a caption, and back, play and next buttons. The drawing sits beside the caption when wide and above it otherwise, the caption shortens when short, and the frame is a local component whose visual slot takes any drawing. It fits every size from 160x160 to 360x480.",
 "prompt": "Explain how a heat pump works in 4 steps, with a simple drawing for each step, step dots, a caption, and back, play and next buttons. The drawing goes beside the caption when wide, the caption shortens when short. It must fit 320x160, 160x160, 360x480, 240x240 and 480x200.",
