  "describe": "How a heat pump works, a loop of four discs with icons (air, compress, home, valve), the current one filled, the fluid's temperature in the middle, four dots, the step title, its caption, back, play and next. 360x480: drawing above, full caption. 480x200: drawing beside, title and full caption. 320x160: beside, short caption, no title. 240x240: above, short caption, no title. 160x160: one big icon for the step, its title and the buttons. Back is dim on step 1, next on step 4. Mono: no play button.",
